{
  "Picks several items. The chosen ones are tags in the field, followed by a text input that searches the list; items come from memory or from a data source, and typed text can become a tag of its own.": "",
  "`x-model` binds an array; every change writes a new one. Created with `new`, the same properties are set programmatically.": "",
  "The list": "",
  "The list keeps open while you choose, shows the chosen items checked and can have a “Select all” row. Each switch is a prop you can bind.": "",
  "With `dataSource` the typed text searches the data source (its `searchFields`). In `'blocks'` mode only the rows in view load; the tags of values on no loaded page are found by key. `maxTags` keeps the field short. This one holds 5,000 customers.": "",
  "Tags of your own": "",
  "With `acceptCustomValue`, Enter adds text that matches no item as a tag; `customValue` shapes it or turns it down. `tagTemplate` draws a tag your way.": "",
  "Choose the highlighted item or let it go; the list stays open. With `acceptCustomValue`, text that matches no item becomes a tag.": "",
  "Remove the last tag.": "",
  "Go to the last tag.": "",
  "Move between the tags; Right on the last one and End go back to the input.": "",
  "Remove it.": "",
  "Close the list; closed, empty the text; then, with `clearButton`, remove every tag.": "",
  "Close the list.": "",
  "The APG combobox with a multi-select listbox: the input is `role=\"combobox\"`, `aria-autocomplete=\"list\"`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`; the list is `aria-multiselectable`.": "",
  "A `role=\"list\"` of `role=\"listitem\"`s; each has a remove button named “Remove …” from `uiLocale`, and the “+3” tag lists the rest in its title.": "",
  "The label names the input; help and errors describe it.": "",
  "The remove buttons (`removeItem`, “Remove {text}”), the “+3” tag (`moreItems`), “Select all”, the buttons and the list texts come from `uiLocale.strings`.": "",
  "Added to the field. `data-open`, `data-text` while text is typed; the field attributes of TextBox.": "",
  "The tags, one tag (`data-loading` while its item is asked for), its text, its remove button.": "",
  "The “+3” tag.": "",
  "The text input and the buttons.": "",
  "The popup and the shared list.": "",
  "Units: a tag (`more`: the \"+N\" tag, `loading`, `focus`, `hover`, `fixed`, `disabled`) and its text.": "",
  "Units: a tag's remove button (`hover`, `pressed`) and its glyph.": "",
  "Units: the box's space round the tags, the tags together, and the arrow that opens the list (`open`).": "",
  "The space between the tags and the field's edge; the narrowest the input gets before it goes to the next line.": "",
  "The list, the list box and the field.": "",
  "The values of the chosen items. `x-model` binds it; every change writes a new array.": "",
  "As for ListBox; groups for items in memory.": "",
  "How and when the typed text searches, as for ComboBox.": "",
  "Enter adds text that matches no item as a tag of its own.": "",
  "the text": "",
  "Makes the value of a typed text; `null` turns it down.": "",
  "`true` (`false` with `acceptCustomValue`)": "",
  "The first match is highlighted while typing, so Enter takes it.": "",
  "Choosing an item closes the list.": "",
  "Tags shown; the rest are counted in one more tag, “+3”. `0` shows all.": "",
  "Items that can be chosen at most; at the limit the others cannot be chosen. `0`: no limit.": "",
  "A \"Select all\" row before the items.": "",
  "Chosen items leave the list (items in memory).": "",
  "A press on the field opens the list.": "",
  "The arrow that opens every item; the button that removes every tag.": "",
  "Draws an item of the list / a tag your way.": "",
  "The items of the chosen values that are known; with a data source the others are found by key.": "",
  "The text input.": "",
  "Opens the list (`false` when disabled or read-only); closes it.": "",
  "Removes every tag.": "",
  "Chooses every item the list shows, up to `maxSelected` (a data source: after their values load).": "",
  "Your items may be plain or reactive; the box reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. The tags, the open list and `selectedItems` follow.": "",
  "The list closed: `'escape'`, `'outside'`, `'focus'` or `'code'`.": ""
